Package: linkr
Type: Package
Title: Reach the Current Linkr Project from a Script
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Linkr", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contact@interhop.org")
Description: Client library for scripts running inside a Linkr IDE session.
    Resolves the project's directories from the environment the kernel or
    terminal was started with, and opens its databases as DBI connections
    without the script having to know where anything lives.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: DBI, duckdb, jsonlite, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
